00:26:13.260 --> 00:26:14.260
Yeah.
Good question.

00:26:14.480 --> 00:26:18.680
Yeah.
So finding that orthogonal to

00:26:18.680 --> 00:26:19.660
the plane,

00:26:19.660 --> 00:26:22.980
to the span of the two of these
two vectors,

00:26:22.980 --> 00:26:27.180
what does that make? That
doesn't make the vector on the

